Contact
Get in touch with SHARAN — for programs, consultations, talks and partnerships.
<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / Contact</div>
    <h1>Contact us</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 62ch;">Whether you want to enrol in a program, host a talk, ask a medical question or partner with us — we'd love to hear from you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feature" id="enrol">
      <div>
        <h2>How can we help?</h2>
        <p>Use the form to send a message. For specific topics, mention the keyword in your note so the right team member picks it up:</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li><strong>Programs</strong> — Diabetes, Hypertension, Weight Release, Healthy Cooking</li>
          <li id="workshop"><strong>Workshops &amp; talks</strong> — host one for your community or company</li>
          <li id="retreat"><strong>Retreats</strong> — ask about upcoming dates and locations</li>
          <li id="books"><strong>Books</strong> — orders, requests, free guides</li>
          <li id="volunteer"><strong>Volunteer</strong> — offer your time or skills</li>
          <li id="partner"><strong>Partner</strong> — clinical, corporate, NGO, media</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-mute" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">Reach us also by email, phone and the social handles in the footer. Replace these placeholders with your live contact details.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="hero-card" data-noop>
        <h3>Send us a message</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field"><label for="f-name">Name</label><input type="text" id="f-name" name="name" required /></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-email">Email</label><input type="email" id="f-email" name="email" required /></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-phone">Phone</label><input type="tel" id="f-phone" name="phone" /></div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-topic">Topic</label>
            <select id="f-topic" name="topic">
              <option>Diabetes Reversal</option>
              <option>Hypertension Reversal</option>
              <option>Weight Release</option>
              <option>Healthy Cooking</option>
              <option>Workshops &amp; talks</option>
              <option>Retreats</option>
              <option>Books</option>
              <option>Volunteer</option>
              <option>Partner</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="f-msg">Your message</label><textarea id="f-msg" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea></div>
          <div class="field full"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="form-note text-mute" hidden style="margin-top: var(--space-2);"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
